cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Weasis in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Weasis DICOM Viewer"
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source DICOM viewer for medical imaging. Runs standalone on Windows,
  macOS and Linux or launches from a web portal, with 2D reading, multiplanar and
  curved reconstruction, MIP, 3D volume rendering, PET/CT fusion with SUV, DICOM
  SEG, RT, SR and ECG support, and PACS and DICOMweb integration.
